+The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank `[REQ-VET-001]`. The directory is published in two forms: the page staff read, and a machine-readable list carrying the same veterinarians and the same specialties for programs to consume `[REQ-VET-003]`.
